-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A data-driven clustering method for time course gene expression data</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>1261</fpage><lpage>1269</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16510852</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ma</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Zhong</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Feng</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Bayesian functional data clustering for temporal microarray data</article-title><source>Int J Plant Genomics</source><year>2008</year><volume>2008</volume><fpage>231897</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18464908</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Moller-Levet</surname><given-names>CS</given-names></name><name><surname>Cho</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolkenhauer</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Microarray data clustering based on temporal variation: FCV with TSD preclustering</article-title><source>Appl Bioinformatics</source><year>2003</year><volume>2</volume><fpage>35</fpage><lpage>45</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15130832</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Phang</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Neville</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudolph</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hunter</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Trajectory clustering: a nonparametric method for grouping gene expression time courses, with applicatio